<section>
  <exercises>
    <heading level="1">1.6 Section Exercises</heading>
    <heading level="1">Verbal</heading>
    <exercise number="1" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>How can you use factoring to simplify rational expressions?</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>You can factor the numerator and denominator to see if any of the terms can cancel one another out.</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="2" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>How do you use the LCD to combine two rational expressions?</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="3" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Tell whether the following statement is true or false and explain why: You only need to find the LCD when adding or subtracting rational expressions.</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>True. Multiplication and division do not require finding the LCD because the denominators can be combined through those operations, whereas addition and subtraction require like terms.</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <heading level="1">Algebraic</heading>
    <paragraph>For the following exercises, simplify the rational expressions.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="4" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{x^{2} - 16}{x^{2} - 5x + 4}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="5" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{y^{2} + 10y + 25}{y^{2} + 11y + 30}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$y+5 y+6 y+5 y+6$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="6" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{6a^{2} - 24a + 24}{6a^{2} - 24}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="7" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{9b^{2} + 18b + 9}{3b + 3}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$3b+3 3b+3$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="8" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{m - 12}{m^{2} - 144}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="9" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{2x^{2} + 7x - 4}{4x^{2} + 2x - 2}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$x+4 2x+2 x+4 2x+2$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="10" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{6x^{2} + 5x - 4}{3x^{2} + 19x + 20}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="11" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{a^{2} + 9a + 18}{a^{2} + 3a - 18}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$a+3 a-3 a+3 a-3$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="12" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{3c^{2} + 25c - 18}{3c^{2} - 23c + 14}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="13" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{12n^{2} - 29n - 8}{28n^{2} - 5n - 3}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$3n-8 7n-3 3n-8 7n-3$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <paragraph>For the following exercises, multiply the rational expressions and express the product in simplest form.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="14" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{x^{2} - x - 6}{2x^{2} + x - 6} \cdot \frac{2x^{2} + 7x - 15}{x^{2} - 9}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="15" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{c^{2} + 2c - 24}{c^{2} + 12c + 36} \cdot \frac{c^{2} - 10c + 24}{c^{2} - 8c + 16}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$c-6 c+6 c-6 c+6$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="16" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{2d^{2} + 9d - 35}{d^{2} + 10d + 21} \cdot \frac{3d^{2} + 2d - 21}{3d^{2} + 14d - 49}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="17" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{10h^{2} - 9h - 9}{2h^{2} - 19h + 24} \cdot \frac{h^{2} - 16h + 64}{5h^{2} - 37h - 24}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$1 1$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="18" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{6b^{2} + 13b + 6}{4b^{2} - 9} \cdot \frac{6b^{2} + 31b - 30}{18b^{2} - 3b - 10}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="19" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{2d^{2} + 15d + 25}{4d^{2} - 25} \cdot \frac{2d^{2} - 15d + 25}{25d^{2} - 1}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$d 2 -25 25 d 2 -1 d 2 -25 25 d 2 -1$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="20" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{6x^{2} - 5x - 50}{15x^{2} - 44x - 20} \cdot \frac{20x^{2} - 7x - 6}{2x^{2} + 9x + 10}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="21" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{t^{2} - 1}{t^{2} + 4t + 3} \cdot \frac{t^{2} + 2t - 15}{t^{2} - 4t + 3}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$t+5 t+3 t+5 t+3$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="22" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{2n^{2} - n - 15}{6n^{2} + 13n - 5} \cdot \frac{12n^{2} - 13n + 3}{4n^{2} - 15n + 9}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="23" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{36x^{2} - 25}{6x^{2} + 65x + 50} \cdot \frac{3x^{2} + 32x + 20}{18x^{2} + 27x + 10}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$6x-5 6x+5 6x-5 6x+5$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <paragraph>For the following exercises, divide the rational expressions.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="24" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{3y^{2} - 7y - 6}{2y^{2} - 3y - 9} \div \frac{y^{2} + y - 2}{2y^{2} + y - 3}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="25" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{6p^{2} + p - 12}{8p^{2} + 18p + 9} \div \frac{6p^{2} - 11p + 4}{2p^{2} + 11p - 6}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$p+6 4p+3 p+6 4p+3$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="26" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{q^{2} - 9}{q^{2} + 6q + 9} \div \frac{q^{2} - 2q - 3}{q^{2} + 2q - 3}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="27" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{18d^{2} + 77d - 18}{27d^{2} - 15d + 2} \div \frac{3d^{2} + 29d - 44}{9d^{2} - 15d + 4}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$2d+9 d+11 2d+9 d+11$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="28" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{16x^{2} + 18x - 55}{32x^{2} - 36x - 11} \div \frac{2x^{2} + 17x + 30}{4x^{2} + 25x + 6}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="29" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{144b^{2} - 25}{72b^{2} - 6b - 10} \div \frac{18b^{2} - 21b + 5}{36b^{2} - 18b - 10}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$12b+5 3b-1 12b+5 3b-1$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="30" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{16a^{2} - 24a + 9}{4a^{2} + 17a - 15} \div \frac{16a^{2} - 9}{4a^{2} + 11a + 6}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="31" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{22y^{2} + 59y + 10}{12y^{2} + 28y - 5} \div \frac{11y^{2} + 46y + 8}{24y^{2} - 10y + 1}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$4y-1 y+4 4y-1 y+4$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="32" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{9x^{2} + 3x - 20}{3x^{2} - 7x + 4} \div \frac{6x^{2} + 4x - 10}{x^{2} - 2x + 1}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <paragraph>For the following exercises, add and subtract the rational expressions, and then simplify.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="33" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{4}{x} + \frac{10}{y}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$10x+4y xy 10x+4y xy$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="34" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{12}{2q} - \frac{6}{3p}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="35" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{4}{a + 1} + \frac{5}{a - 3}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$9a-7 a 2 -2a-3 9a-7 a 2 -2a-3$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="36" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{c + 2}{3} - \frac{c - 4}{4}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="37" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{y + 3}{y - 2} + \frac{y - 3}{y + 1}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$2 y 2 -y+9 y 2 -y-2 2 y 2 -y+9 y 2 -y-2$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="38" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{x - 1}{x + 1} - \frac{2x + 3}{2x + 1}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="39" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{3z}{z + 1} + \frac{2z + 5}{z - 2}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$5 z 2 +z+5 z 2 -z-2 5 z 2 +z+5 z 2 -z-2$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="40" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{4p}{p + 1} - \frac{p + 1}{4p}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$( 3x+5 )( 3x-5 ) ( 3x+5 )( 3x-5 )$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="41" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{x}{x + 1} + \frac{y}{y + 1}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$x+2xy+y x+xy+y+1 x+2xy+y x+xy+y+1$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <paragraph>For the following exercises, simplify the rational expression.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="42" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{6}{y} - \frac{4}{x}}{y}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="43" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{2}{a} + \frac{7}{b}}{b}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$2b+7a a b 2 2b+7a a b 2$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="44" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{x}{4} - \frac{p}{8}}{p}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="45" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{3}{a} + \frac{b}{6}}{\frac{2b}{3a}}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$18+ab 4b 18+ab 4b$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="46" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{3}{x + 1} + \frac{2}{x - 1}}{\frac{x - 1}{x + 1}}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="47" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{a}{b} - \frac{b}{a}}{\frac{a + b}{ab}}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$a-b a-b$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="48" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{2x}{3} + \frac{4x}{7}}{\frac{x}{2}}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="49" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{2c}{c + 2} + \frac{c - 1}{c + 1}}{\frac{2c + 1}{c + 1}}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$3 c 2 +3c-2 2 c 2 +5c+2 3 c 2 +3c-2 2 c 2 +5c+2$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="50" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{x}{y} - \frac{y}{x}}{\frac{x}{y} + \frac{y}{x}}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <heading level="1">Real-World Applications</heading>
    <exercise number="51" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Brenda is placing tile on her bathroom floor. The area of the floor is $$15x^{2} - 8x - 7$$ ft2. The area of one tile is $$x^{2} - 2x + 1 \text{ft} ^{2}.$$ To find the number of tiles needed, simplify the rational expression: $$\frac{15x^{2} - 8x - 7}{x^{2} - 2x + 1}.$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$15x+7 x-1 15x+7 x-1$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="52" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>The area of Lijuan's yard is $$25x^{2} - 625$$ ft2. A patch of sod has an area of $$x^{2} - 10x + 25$$ ft2. Divide the two areas and simplify to find how many pieces of sod Lijuan needs to cover her yard.</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="53" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Elroi wants to mulch his garden. His garden is $$x^{2} + 18x + 81$$ ft2. One bag of mulch covers $$x^{2} - 81$$ ft2. Divide the expressions and simplify to find how many bags of mulch Elroi needs to mulch his garden.</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$x+9 x-9 x+9 x-9$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <heading level="1">Extensions</heading>
    <paragraph>For the following exercises, perform the given operations and simplify.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="54" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{x^{2} + x - 6}{x^{2} - 2x - 3} \cdot \frac{2x^{2} - 3x - 9}{x^{2} - x - 2} \div \frac{10x^{2} + 27x + 18}{x^{2} + 2x + 1}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="55" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{3y^{2} - 10y + 3}{3y^{2} + 5y - 2} \cdot \frac{2y^{2} - 3y - 20}{2y^{2} - y - 15}}{y - 4}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$1 y+2 1 y+2$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="56" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{\frac{4a + 1}{2a - 3} + \frac{2a - 3}{2a + 3}}{\frac{4a^{2} + 9}{a}}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="57" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>$$\frac{x^{2} + 7x + 12}{x^{2} + x - 6} \div \frac{3x^{2} + 19x + 28}{8x^{2} - 4x - 24} \div \frac{2x^{2} + x - 3}{3x^{2} + 4x - 7}$$</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$4 4$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
  </exercises>
</section>
